{"4447830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TURBOZOD", "steam_appid": 4447830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Born to Fight. Built to Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were engineered in a secret laboratory to be the perfect biological weapon. Now that you are free, the entire galaxy is your arena. Your memory is wiped, but your combat instincts are sharper than ever. Travel from planet to planet, crush the fiercest warriors in the cosmos, and carve a path of destruction straight to the mastermind who created you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/d1d9e6c021c5f4938c52096d53bfe45f.poster.avif?t=1779456033\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/d1d9e6c021c5f4938c52096d53bfe45f.webm?t=1779456033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/d1d9e6c021c5f4938c52096d53bfe45f.mp4?t=1779456033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deep Progression and Endless Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mold your ultimate fighter exactly how you want. Invest your stat points, unlock a massive tree of active and passive abilities, and hunt down gear across seven different equipment slots.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind for Legendary Gear:</strong> Defeat planetary bosses for a chance at rare, epic, and legendary drops. Every item you find features up to five randomized stat rolls, making every drop exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle and Upgrade:</strong> Turn your unwanted junk into valuable resources through the fusion system. To truly maximize your potential, use rare cosmic crystals to push your favorite weapons and armor beyond their normal limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/9592ad49d6b2bd406c511bdfe4da277a.poster.avif?t=1779456033\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/9592ad49d6b2bd406c511bdfe4da277a.webm?t=1779456033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/9592ad49d6b2bd406c511bdfe4da277a.mp4?t=1779456033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Attack Speed:</strong> Scale your combat speed infinitely to overwhelm your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization:</strong> Build the ultimate martial artist with precise stat allocation and huge skill trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy RPG Loot System:</strong> Farm for randomized legendary gear, fuse items, and upgrade your loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Travel Prestige:</strong> Rewind time to gain permanent power boosts and unlock deeper progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Definitive Version:</strong> Fully rebuilt with major bug fixes, polish, and gameplay improvements for the ultimate experience.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Born to Fight. Built to Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were engineered in a secret laboratory to be the perfect biological weapon. Now that you are free, the entire galaxy is your arena. Your memory is wiped, but your combat instincts are sharper than ever. Travel from planet to planet, crush the fiercest warriors in the cosmos, and carve a path of destruction straight to the mastermind who created you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/d1d9e6c021c5f4938c52096d53bfe45f.poster.avif?t=1779456033\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/d1d9e6c021c5f4938c52096d53bfe45f.webm?t=1779456033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/d1d9e6c021c5f4938c52096d53bfe45f.mp4?t=1779456033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deep Progression and Endless Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mold your ultimate fighter exactly how you want. Invest your stat points, unlock a massive tree of active and passive abilities, and hunt down gear across seven different equipment slots.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind for Legendary Gear:</strong> Defeat planetary bosses for a chance at rare, epic, and legendary drops. Every item you find features up to five randomized stat rolls, making every drop exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle and Upgrade:</strong> Turn your unwanted junk into valuable resources through the fusion system. To truly maximize your potential, use rare cosmic crystals to push your favorite weapons and armor beyond their normal limits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/9592ad49d6b2bd406c511bdfe4da277a.poster.avif?t=1779456033\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/9592ad49d6b2bd406c511bdfe4da277a.webm?t=1779456033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/extras/9592ad49d6b2bd406c511bdfe4da277a.mp4?t=1779456033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Attack Speed:</strong> Scale your combat speed infinitely to overwhelm your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization:</strong> Build the ultimate martial artist with precise stat allocation and huge skill trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy RPG Loot System:</strong> Farm for randomized legendary gear, fuse items, and upgrade your loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Travel Prestige:</strong> Rewind time to gain permanent power boosts and unlock deeper progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Definitive Version:</strong> Fully rebuilt with major bug fixes, polish, and gameplay improvements for the ultimate experience.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are an engineered martial arts weapon with no memories and physics defying speed. Escape the lab, explore the galaxy, and hunt your creator in this fast paced, loot heavy RPG. Bend time itself to become the ultimate fighting machine!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4447830/622822224fc496c9c67a8d541e8757f1d255cd96/header.jpg?t=1779456033", "capsule_image": "